### Get All Stores 
GET http://localhost:5173/stores

### Get Store Catalog by Slug
GET http://localhost:5173/stores/divinestore

### POST : sell item 
POST http://localhost:5173/stores/divinestore
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "amount": 1,
    "item_id": "b6ad975d-ddec-11f1-9b33-aef6d56498d4"
}

### GET user inventory
GET http://localhost:5173/knight

### POST : user sell item
POST http://localhost:5173/knight/divinestore
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "amount": 1,
    "item_id": "b6ad975d-ddec-11f1-9b33-aef6d56498d4"
}